WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.467 --> 00:00:03.536
-Guys, whenever I get some
downtime here at the show,

00:00:03.536 --> 00:00:05.938
I like to go on Instagram and
I scroll through all the photos.

00:00:05.938 --> 00:00:07.940
And one thing I've noticed is
that, a lot of times,

00:00:07.940 --> 00:00:09.742
two people will write
the same exact caption,

00:00:09.742 --> 00:00:12.278
but the pictures they post
will be completely different.

00:00:12.278 --> 00:00:15.147
I'll show you what I mean.
It's time for "Picture This."

00:00:15.147 --> 00:00:18.284
-♪ Picture this, picture this,
picture this ♪

00:00:18.284 --> 00:00:20.152
♪ Yeah, picture this ♪

00:00:20.152 --> 00:00:22.622
-Alright, let's take a look at
this first example.

00:00:22.622 --> 00:00:24.724
It's from Macy's and
the U.S. Justice Department.

00:00:24.724 --> 00:00:26.025
-Really?

00:00:26.025 --> 00:00:28.261 line:0%
-Yeah, they both wrote, "He sees
you when you're sleeping,

00:00:28.261 --> 00:00:29.996 line:0%
he knows when you're awake."

00:00:29.996 --> 00:00:32.265 line:0%
Macy's posted
a picture of Santa.

00:00:32.265 --> 00:00:34.967 line:0%
The Justice Department posted a
picture of Mark Zuckerberg.

00:00:34.967 --> 00:00:36.168 line:0%
-Oh.

00:00:36.168 --> 00:00:38.671 line:0%
-You see?
-Wow.

00:00:38.671 --> 00:00:42.108 line:0%
-This next one is from Disney
and Bill de Blasio.

00:00:42.108 --> 00:00:43.509 line:0%
They both wrote, "Take a trip

00:00:43.509 --> 00:00:45.944 line:0%
with characters
from another galaxy."

00:00:45.944 --> 00:00:49.248 line:0%
Disney posted a picture of their
new "Star Wars" cruise.

00:00:49.248 --> 00:00:52.018 line:0%
Bill de Blasio posted a picture
of the F Train at 2:00 a.m.

00:00:52.018 --> 00:00:53.019 line:0%
-Wow.

00:00:53.019 --> 00:00:54.854 line:0%
-Wow.
-Where's the lie?

00:00:54.854 --> 00:00:56.522 line:0%
-No, he wouldn't...

00:00:56.522 --> 00:00:58.624 line:0%
Here's one from
Netflix and Rite Aid.

00:00:58.624 --> 00:01:01.561 line:0%
They both wrote, "Still going
strong, four years later."

00:01:01.561 --> 00:01:03.463 line:0%
Netflix posted a picture of
the new season of

00:01:03.463 --> 00:01:04.764 line:0%
"Stranger Things."

00:01:04.764 --> 00:01:06.665 line:0%
Rite Aid posted a picture of
the ChapStick

00:01:06.665 --> 00:01:09.536 line:0%
that's been in your coat pocket
for the last four years.

00:01:11.204 --> 00:01:13.639 line:0%
-Hey!

00:01:13.639 --> 00:01:15.241 line:0%
-Next one is from
the National Parks Service

00:01:15.241 --> 00:01:16.242 line:0%
and Target.

00:01:16.242 --> 00:01:17.677 line:0%
-Wow!

00:01:17.677 --> 00:01:20.579 line:0%
-They both wrote, "Careful, this
could explode at any moment."

00:01:20.579 --> 00:01:23.782 line:0%
National Parks Service posted a
picture of Old Faithful.

00:01:23.782 --> 00:01:26.118 line:0%
Target posted a picture
of Pillsbury Crescent Rolls.

00:01:26.118 --> 00:01:27.219 line:0%
Yeah, that's...

00:01:27.219 --> 00:01:29.088 line:0%
They're frightening.

00:01:29.088 --> 00:01:31.891 line:0%
-Whoo-hoo-hoo!

00:01:31.891 --> 00:01:33.259 line:0%
-You know it's coming, too.
-Yeah.

00:01:33.259 --> 00:01:35.428 line:0%
-You're just like...

00:01:35.428 --> 00:01:38.097 line:0%
-[ Giggles ]

00:01:38.097 --> 00:01:40.500 line:0%
-Yeah, he laughs at you.
-He laughs. Laughs at you.

00:01:40.500 --> 00:01:41.601 line:0%
-Yeah.

00:01:43.235 --> 00:01:44.870 line:0%
The Pillsbury Doughboy doesn't
laugh with you.

00:01:44.870 --> 00:01:45.939 line:0%
-With you. No.

00:01:45.939 --> 00:01:48.073 line:0%
-He laughs at you.
-He laughs at you.

00:01:48.073 --> 00:01:49.908 line:0%
-Did not know that.
-No.

00:01:49.908 --> 00:01:52.111 line:0%
[ Both giggle ]

00:01:52.111 --> 00:01:55.014 line:0%
"You son of a bitch."
Hey!

00:01:55.014 --> 00:01:56.682 line:0%
No need!

00:01:56.682 --> 00:01:59.819 line:0%
-Next up, this one's from two
HBO Max subscribers.

00:01:59.819 --> 00:02:01.954 line:0%
They both wrote, "I was going to
get rid of HBO Max,

00:02:01.954 --> 00:02:03.455 line:0%
but then I saw this."

00:02:03.455 --> 00:02:06.659 line:0%
One subscriber posted a picture
of the "Harry Potter" reunion.

00:02:06.659 --> 00:02:08.594 line:0%
Other subscriber posted
a picture of

00:02:08.594 --> 00:02:11.231 line:0%
his friend's HBO Max password.

00:02:12.798 --> 00:02:14.734 line:0%
We can't sign off now.

00:02:14.734 --> 00:02:17.370 line:0%
This last one is from
Adele and your uncle.

00:02:17.370 --> 00:02:19.739 line:0%
They both wrote, "It was an
overwhelming journey,

00:02:19.739 --> 00:02:20.974 line:0%
but I'm glad it's out."

00:02:20.974 --> 00:02:23.209 line:0%
Adele posted a picture of her
new album, "30."

00:02:23.209 --> 00:02:24.711 line:0%
Your uncle posted a picture of

00:02:24.711 --> 00:02:26.679 line:0%
his belly after
Thanksgiving dinner.

00:02:26.679 --> 00:02:28.248 line:0%
That's all the time we have for
"Picture This."

